---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Seller dashboard preview" description="A visual preview of the future InfiniCharm seller workspace. Authentication and live data are not connected.">
  <section class="dashboard-shell container">
    <div class="dashboard-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">SELLER STUDIO / PREVIEW</p><h1>Your store,<br /><span class="coral-text">in one place.</span></h1><p class="page-intro">A layout preview for the future seller workspace. No seller account, database, or real orders are connected.</p></div><span class="status-pill"><span></span> UI PREVIEW ONLY</span></div>
    <div class="dashboard-warning"><strong>Preview mode</strong><span>These numbers are examples, not live business data. This page is public and must not be used for real seller operations.</span></div>
    <div class="metric-grid"><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">TOTAL SALES</span><strong>₹0</strong><span class="metric-footnote">Will be calculated from verified orders</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">ACTIVE PRODUCTS</span><strong>0</strong><span class="metric-footnote">No inventory connected</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">OPEN ORDERS</span><strong>0</strong><span class="metric-footnote">Order system not built yet</span></article><article class="metric-card"><span class="eyebrow">STORE STATUS</span><strong class="metric-status">Not connected</strong><span class="metric-footnote">Seller onboarding comes later</span></article></div>
    <div class="dashboard-content-grid"><section class="dashboard-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">NEXT STEPS</p><h2>Build your store</h2></div><span class="mono panel-index">01 / 03</span></div><div class="checklist-row"><span class="checklist-number">01</span><div><strong>Create seller account</strong><p>Authentication and seller approval will be built in Phase 2.</p></div><span class="task-status">PLANNED</span></div><div class="checklist-row"><span class="checklist-number">02</span><div><strong>Add your products</strong><p>Product data, image upload permissions, and stock validation.</p></div><span class="task-status">PLANNED</span></div><div class="checklist-row"><span class="checklist-number">03</span><div><strong>Manage orders</strong><p>Secure order lifecycle and auditable seller actions.</p></div><span class="task-status">PLANNED</span></div></section><section class="dashboard-panel dashboard-side-panel"><p class="eyebrow">SELLER SUPPORT</p><div class="side-feature-mark">✳</div><h2>Thoughtful tools<br />for every seller.</h2><p>Inventory, fulfilment, buyer questions, and sales insights will live here when the backend is connected.</p><a class="button button-outline" href="/about/">View project roadmap <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
